{"id":"4d404272197961a325701200986397b6f7f37bfb","url":"https://www.ithome.com/0/988/965.htm","title":"荣耀罗巍：Robot Phone 手机预定超过 40 万台","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"IT之家 (ITHome)","byline":"作者：归泷","excerpt":"在今晚的荣耀 Robot Phone 全球新品发布会上，全球首款机器人手机 —— 荣耀 Robot Phone 正式发布，定价 9,999 元起。荣耀首席影像工程师罗巍透露，Robot Phone 手机预定超过 40 万台。他直言：“再不下手估计买不到了。”#荣耀 Robot Phone#","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"paragraph\">\r\n            \r\n            <p data-vmark=\"a6a6\"><a href=\"https://www.ithome.com/\" target=\"_blank\">IT之家</a> 8 月 12 日消息，在今晚的荣耀 Robot Phone 全球新品发布会上，<a href=\"https://www.ithome.com/0/988/961.htm\" target=\"_blank\">全球首款机器人手机 —— 荣耀 Robot Phone 正式发布</a>，定价 9,999 元起。</p><p data-vmark=\"a65c\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/086c21cd-aaa9-4194-a563-59c222553e8b.jpg?x-bce-process=image/auto-orient,o_1\" w=\"1420\" h=\"1065\" data-vmark=\"15e4\" title=\"荣耀罗巍：Robot Phone 手机预定超过 40 万台\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/086c21cd-aaa9-4194-a563-59c222553e8b.jpg?x-bce-process=image/auto-orient,o_1\" width=\"1420\" height=\"615\"></p><ul><li><p data-vmark=\"3642\">12GB+512GB：9,999 元</p></li><li><p data-vmark=\"6153\">16GB+1TB：12,999 元</p></li></ul><dir><a contenteditable=\"false\" href=\"https://u.jd.com/UOUDaiB\" target=\"_blank\" data-wapurl=\"https://u.jd.com/UGUJSYK\" data-iosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/UOUNszd\" data-androidurl=\"https://u.jd.com/UOUlE7N\" data-hosnexturl=\"https://u.jd.com/UgUYOia\" data-hosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/UaUEz71\" data-uwpurl=\"https://u.jd.com/UgUrZX1\" data-wxmpurl=\"ithome://openmp?appid=wx91d27dbf599dff74&path=%2fpages%2funion%2fproxy%2fproxy%3fspreadUrl%3dhttps%253a%252f%252fu.jd.com%252fUaUy8KJ%26EA_PTAG%3d17078.27.380\" data-itwxurl=\"https://u.jd.com/UgUPflq\" data-lpwxurl=\"https://u.jd.com/UrUZIRk\" data-ncid=\"217014\"><span><span><img src=\"https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/488595/35/4592/31565/6a66b6f9F768d7781/008332032076ea75.png\" w=\"800\" h=\"800\" title=\"荣耀罗巍：Robot Phone 手机预定超过 40 万台\" data-original=\"https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/488595/35/4592/31565/6a66b6f9F768d7781/008332032076ea75.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\"></span><span><span><span>京东</span><span>荣耀 Robot Phone</span></span><span></span><span><span>9999 元起</span><span>直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><p data-vmark=\"aa34\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/99c6e473-f3f6-45fd-85d1-3ddc382536e4.jpg?x-bce-process=image/auto-orient,o_1\" w=\"1440\" h=\"997\" data-vmark=\"ce33\" title=\"荣耀罗巍：Robot Phone 手机预定超过 40 万台\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/99c6e473-f3f6-45fd-85d1-3ddc382536e4.jpg?x-bce-process=image/auto-orient,o_1\" width=\"1440\" height=\"568\"></p><p data-vmark=\"0292\">IT之家注意到，荣耀首席影像工程师罗巍透露，<strong>Robot Phone 手机预定超过 40 万台</strong>。他直言：“再不下手估计买不到了。”</p><p data-vmark=\"411f\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/1314480e-810b-4323-b606-07b3d0e1e680.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" w=\"702\" h=\"683\" data-snap-from=\"%7B%22from%22%3A%22weibo%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fweibo.com%2F7279906852%2FRd5oBDMCA%22%7D\" data-vmark=\"bdbd\" title=\"荣耀罗巍：Robot Phone 手机预定超过 40 万台\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/1314480e-810b-4323-b606-07b3d0e1e680.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" width=\"702\" height=\"683\"></p><p data-vmark=\"3080\">IT之家从荣耀发布会了解到，Robot Phone 是荣耀与顶级电影摄影机厂商 ARRI（阿莱）合作的首款落地产品，融合了荣耀的移动影像以及 ARRI 百年底蕴的电影摄影技术。</p><p data-vmark=\"2498\">硬件方面，荣耀 Robot Phone 后置三摄方案包含一颗 2 亿像素 F1.6 光圈、等效 23 毫米的 4D 云台主摄，一颗 5000 万像素超广角镜头，以及一颗 2 亿像素潜望式长焦镜头。该机还首发自研影像芯片“荣耀驭光 H1”，云台主摄 CMOS 尺寸达 1/1.28 英寸。</p><p data-vmark=\"a269\">参数方面，荣耀 Robot Phone 搭载第五代骁龙 8 至尊版芯片，配备一块 6.31 英寸的 1.5K 分辨率四等边直屏。该机内置端侧大模型 YOYO，具备情感感知能力，能够主动识别用户的情绪状态、使用习惯及当前所处环境。</p><p data-vmark=\"c11a\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/f887726e-f8e7-4a74-a18c-f19d45514af9.jpg?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" w=\"1440\" h=\"3240\" data-vmark=\"78c5\" title=\"荣耀罗巍：Robot Phone 手机预定超过 40 万台\" data-original=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/f887726e-f8e7-4a74-a18c-f19d45514af9.jpg?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1845\"></p><dir><a contenteditable=\"false\" href=\"https://u.jd.com/UOUDaiB\" target=\"_blank\" data-wapurl=\"https://u.jd.com/UGUJSYK\" data-iosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/UOUNszd\" data-androidurl=\"https://u.jd.com/UOUlE7N\" data-hosnexturl=\"https://u.jd.com/UgUYOia\" data-hosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/UaUEz71\" data-uwpurl=\"https://u.jd.com/UgUrZX1\" data-wxmpurl=\"ithome://openmp?appid=wx91d27dbf599dff74&path=%2fpages%2funion%2fproxy%2fproxy%3fspreadUrl%3dhttps%253a%252f%252fu.jd.com%252fUaUy8KJ%26EA_PTAG%3d17078.27.380\" data-itwxurl=\"https://u.jd.com/UgUPflq\" data-lpwxurl=\"https://u.jd.com/UrUZIRk\" data-ncid=\"217014\"><span><span><img src=\"https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/488595/35/4592/31565/6a66b6f9F768d7781/008332032076ea75.png\" w=\"800\" h=\"800\" title=\"荣耀罗巍：Robot Phone 手机预定超过 40 万台\" data-original=\"https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/488595/35/4592/31565/6a66b6f9F768d7781/008332032076ea75.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\"></span><span><span><span>京东</span><span>荣耀 Robot Phone</span></span><span></span><span><span>9999 元起</span><span>直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><p data-vmark=\"38c1\">2026 年数码家电政府补贴持续进行中，IT 之家为大家汇总国补领券地址，买数码家电之前记得领取。</p><p data-vmark=\"8be9\"><strong>数码补贴：<a href=\"https://u.jd.com/AO9cF1s\" target=\"_blank\" data-wapurl=\"https://u.jd.com/AO9DrqM\" data-iosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/Ag91Sjs\" data-androidurl=\"https://u.jd.com/AG9pxhC\" data-hosnexturl=\"https://u.jd.com/AO9fCAz\" data-hosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/Ar9P2XE\" data-uwpurl=\"https://u.jd.com/Ar9Jnih\" data-wxmpurl=\"ithome://openmp?appid=wx91d27dbf599dff74&path=%2fpages%2funion%2fproxy%2fproxy%3fspreadUrl%3dhttps%253a%252f%252fu.jd.com%252fA19cSnL%26EA_PTAG%3d17078.27.380\" data-ncid=\"122908\">点此领券</a></strong></p><ul><li>